window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I kissed a hot fae guy to start a temporary mate bond between us, and now I'm pretending I haven't been seeing visions of our future together for the past year and a half. <br> <br> At first, I didn't realize what I was seeing. Who would assume steamy dreams and brutal nightmares were what the future held?<br> <br> But then my fake mate, who was the subject of said hot dreams, hauled me off to his house and told me I belonged to him.<br> <br> That abduction just about set off the horrific future I've seen coming. Now, I have to figure out a way to stop this war before it happens, or we'll have much bigger problems than my temporary mate's possessive declaration that I'm his. </p> <p>This is the second in a series of steamy connected standalones. Humor and happily ever after guaranteed!</p>"; 
